From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] include QGuiApplication for the focus-window query

License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Upstream-Status: downstream-only
Origin: exact-source audit and run 34686802262 compiler evidence

requestActivate() calls QGuiApplication::focusWindow(), but this translation
unit does not include QGuiApplication. The Qt 6.5 private headers do not
provide that declaration transitively. Include the public QtGui header
directly; activation behavior and all Wayland functionality remain unchanged.

Remove when upstream directly includes the QGuiApplication declaration.

--- a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
+++ b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
@@ -4,2 +4,3 @@

+#include <QtGui/QGuiApplication>
 #include <QtWaylandClient/private/qwaylandinputdevice_p.h>
